Journey: Form login, a wrong password and basic auth
Tags: @the-internet @auth
Base URL: https://the-internet.herokuapp.com
HTTP credentials: admin / ${basicPassword}
Variables: basicPassword=admin, password=SuperSecretPassword!

Open /login
Type "tomsmith" into the Username field
Type "wrong" into the Password field
Click the "Login" button
  Expect the page contains "Your password is invalid!"
  Expect the URL contains "/login"
Type "tomsmith" into the Username field
Type "${password}" into the Password field
Click the "Login" button
  Expect the URL contains "/secure"
  Expect I see "You logged into a secure area!"
Click the "Logout" link
  Expect user is redirected to "/login"
  Expect the page contains "You logged out of the secure area!"

Open /basic_auth
Expect the page contains "Congratulations! You must have the proper credentials."
